<title>JAPAN: TDK sags on Seagate Tech earnings warning.</title>
<headline>TDK sags on Seagate Tech earnings warning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TDK Corp shares sagged in Thursday afternoon trade, after leading U.S. disk drive-maker Seagate Technology Inc said overnight that its qaurterly results will fall short of expectations, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0528 GMT, shares of TDK, which is involved in producing parts used in hard disk drives, were down 90 yen at 8,230 yen.  </p>
<p>MR heads read information from magnetic disks.</p>
